              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लुढ़काना — luṛhkānā — \"to roll (something)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बच्चों ने टीले से पत्थर नीचे लुढ़काए। baccoṁ ne ṭīle se patthar nīce luṛhkāe. The children rolled stones down the mound."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने ढोल लुढ़काया, usne ḍhol luṛhkāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "लुढ़काना (luṛhkānā) is the causative partner of लुढ़कना, \"to roll\", from Sanskrit luṭhati, \"rolls\" (CDIAL 11079): लुढ़कना is to roll, लुढ़काना to roll a thing."
            }
          ]
